      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gio/gdbusactiongroup.c"
           line="31">`GDBusActionGroup` is an implementation of the [iface@Gio.ActionGroup]
interface.

`GDBusActionGroup` can be used as a proxy for an action group
that is exported over D-Bus with [method@Gio.DBusConnection.export_action_group].</doc>
