          <instance-parameter name="self" transfer-ownership="none">
            <doc xml:space="preserve"
                 filename="gio/gdebugcontrollerdbus.c"
                 line="664">a #GDebugControllerDBus</doc>
            <type name="DebugControllerDBus" c:type="GDebugControllerDBus*"/>
          </instance-parameter>
        </parameters>
      </method>
      <property name="connection"
                version="2.72"
                writable="1"
                construct-only="1"
                transfer-ownership="none">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gio/gdebugcontrollerdbus.c"
             line="552">The D-Bus connection to expose the debugging interface on.

Typically this will be the same connection (to the system or session bus)
which the rest of the application or service’s D-Bus objects are registered
