    <constant name="FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TIME_CHANGED"
              value="time::changed"
              c:type="G_FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TIME_CHANGED">
      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gio/gfileinfo.h"
           line="608">A key in the "time" namespace for getting the time the file was last
changed.

Corresponding #GFileAttributeType is %G_FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TYPE_UINT64,
and contains the time since the file was last changed, in seconds since
the UNIX epoch.

This corresponds to the traditional UNIX ctime.</doc>
