      <virtual-method name="append_to_async"
                      invoker="append_to_async"
                      glib:finish-func="append_to_finish"
                      glib:sync-func="append_to">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gio/gfile.c"
             line="2165">Asynchronously opens @file for appending.

For more details, see g_file_append_to() which is
the synchronous version of this call.

When the operation is finished, @callback will be called.
You can then call g_file_append_to_finish() to get the result
of the operation.</doc>
