        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gio/gnotification.c"
             line="364">Sets the type of @notification to @category. Categories have a main
type like `email`, `im` or `device` and can have a detail separated
by a `.`, e.g. `im.received` or `email.arrived`. Setting the category
helps the notification server to select proper feedback to the user.

Standard categories are [listed in the specification](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/notification-spec/latest/ar01s06.html).</doc>
